战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,68,41,39,59,48],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10064","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,68,41,39,59,48],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁术部将，袁术称帝时被封为大将军。张勋奉命与桥蕤攻吕布于徐州。其轻信韩暹、杨奉结盟，致七路大军瞬间崩溃，士卒溃散如鸟兽，张勋仅率亲兵突围。","tc":"袁術部將，袁術稱帝時被封為大將軍。張勛奉命與橋蕤攻呂布于徐州。其輕信韓暹、楊奉結盟，致七路大軍瞬間崩潰，士卒潰散如鳥獸，張勛僅率親兵突圍。","en":"Officer under Yuan Shu, appointed Grand General when Yuan Shu proclaimed himself emperor. Zhang Xun was ordered to attack Lu Bu in Xu Province alongside Qiao Rui. His naive trust in the alliance with Han Xian and Yang Feng led to the instant collapse of the seven-pronged army, with soldiers scattering like startled birds. Zhang Xun barely escaped with only his personal guard.","jp":"袁術の配下武将。袁術の皇帝即位に伴い大将軍に任じられた。張勲は命を受け、橋蕤とともに徐州の呂布を攻めたが、韓暹や楊奉と同盟を結んだと軽信したため、七路の大軍は瞬く間に瓦解した。兵卒は鳥獣の如く四散し、張勲はわずかに親兵を率いて包囲を突破するのみであった。","kr":"원술 휘하의 장수로, 원술이 칭제했을 때 대장군에 봉해졌다. 장훈은 명을 받고 교유와 함께 서주에서 여포를 공격했다. 그러나 한섬·양봉과의 결맹을 섣불리 믿은 탓에 7로 대군이 순식간에 와해되어 군사들이 조수처럼 흩어졌고, 장훈은 겨우 친병만을 이끌고 포위를 뚫었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10294","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"勋","nameTc":"勛","nameEn":"Xun","nameJp":"勲","nameKr":"훈","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张勋","power":"WJ10064","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0"